    "bky_video_testimonials_UKA3Wn": {
      "type": "bky-video-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "video_testimonial_9NwKVR": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/9.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Ashly S.",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>For Christmas, I decided to get two of these Rain drums. They come with an excellent instruction guide, and the drumsticks that are thoughtfully included are a huge hit with my toddlers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_testimonial_UXpEMN": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/8.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Maria Z.",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>We bought this to place outside so the rain could fall on it. It isn’t very loud, but it makes a subtle, beautiful sound when it rains. My partner and I love sitting by the window and listening to it during a storm. I also like the non-slip bottom, since it makes it less likely to tip over in strong wind.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_testimonial_yb64AH": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/7.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Pete",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>This one reminds me more of ceramic, and it definitely has a different sound too. It’s a cute little rain drum, and I love how bright and pretty the color is. It’s good quality and easy to use, so making sounds and playing music comes naturally. The tone is really calming.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_testimonial_LNRMVT": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/6.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Linda M.",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>Really nice drum, and it’s so fun to play. It sounds great! Worth every penny.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_testimonial_WKkPyP": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/5.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Carolyn Z.",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>I bought this as a gift and loved it so much that I got a smaller one for myself! I waited a week for rain so I could finally hear it in the garden, and the tone it makes is perfect. I’d recommend it for all ages.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_testimonial_b8GdFk": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/4.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Mahinder G.",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>It sounds so calming. The quality is great, and it’s a great price for what you get. I got the Rain drums, and it’s even fun to play with the sticks. I’d definitely gift this to someone!</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_testimonial_3W4hwP": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/3.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Heather",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>I bought this for my son for Christmas, and he plays with it all the time. It’s great quality, easy to use, and has good sound. It’s so much fun, I love it too! The only problem is my kids won’t let me play on it because they hog it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "video_testimonial_7ri8ja": {
          "type": "video_testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "video": "shopify://files/videos/2.mp4",
            "video_url": "",
            "unmute_label": "",
            "avatar_color": "",
            "client_name": "Mahayar",
            "show_verified": true,
            "rating": 5,
            "review_heading": "",
            "testimonial": "<p>I bought this as a birthday present for my favorite coworker, and what a nice product it is. He sent me a video from his porch, sipping hot tea in the rain and enjoying the sound. The tone is so warm and relaxing. I’m planning to get one for my daughter and my mom for Christmas. It’s truly worth the price, which is hard to find these days.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
